        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-CS-84072-RECKN, Select Knurled Refrigerator Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Emtek Select Knurled Appliance Pull is a sleek and stunning addition to modern kitchen hardware. Available in trending finishes, it comes in two sizes: 24-inch and 36-inch, with easy installation using three mounting posts. Elevate your kitchen's aesthetics with its contemporary design and exquisite knurled texture. Upgrade your space with this premium Emtek appliance pull that combines style, functionality, and lasting quality. Transform your kitchen into a stunning showcase of contemporary style with this premium hardware choice from Emtek.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Select Knurled Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-84073-specifications.pdf?v=1718159606\"><b>Emtek Select Knurled Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CS-84072-RECKN:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CS-84073-RECKN:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stem/Mount Finish and the Bar Pull Finish are selected individually so you can mix and match colors for a unique look!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Finish7SCU.jpg?v=1704354538\" width=\"600\" height=\"114\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Select Knurled Appliance Pull",
                "description": "The Emtek Select Knurled Appliance Pull is a sleek and stunning addition to modern kitchen hardware. Available in trending finishes, it comes in two sizes: 24-inch and 36-inch, with easy installation using three mounting posts. Elevate your kitchen's aesthetics with its contemporary design and exquisite knurled texture. Upgrade your space with this premium Emtek appliance pull that combines style, functionality, and lasting quality. Transform your kitchen into a stunning showcase of contemporary style with this premium hardware choice from Emtek.",
